	(text "Q2204 discharges through R2210 || R2211 = 340 Ohm.\nU2203 disables discharge; R2205 bleeds residual charge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23 139.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "01e53a8f-0f63-4a95-997b-77188c06b4c1")
	)
	(text "This path provides PROG_N15 to MIRA's bipolar stimulus circuitry for\nmemristor READ/SET/RESET operations. It connects N15 under hardware\nauthorization and disconnects the output when permission is removed.\nDownstream matrix electronics define stimulus amplitude and pulse timing;\nforming uses a separate branch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 45.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1f760ce3-854c-4d92-8a73-27a51ff379fa")
	)
	(text "Without optocoupler drive, Q2203 equalizes pass G-S.\nU2202 releases this clamp during authorized operation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23 88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "28c8784b-6107-4f97-af7a-c55cbf486086")
	)
	(text "N15 is the negative power input; AON supplies the control side. Sinking\nMATRIX_OPTO_K lights U2201-U2203 through R2201, R2206 and R2208 (300 Ohm\neach). U2201 raises the pass gates through R2203 (330 kOhm), U2202 releases\nthe OFF clamp and U2203 disables output discharge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 65.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "292f9749-0863-439f-a5e4-1fb30762c58b")
	)
	(text "Output voltage setting"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 111.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.9 1.9)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "44f4968f-2da7-46aa-9aea-bfdb687c3267")
	)
	(text "Without optocoupler drive, Q2203 equalizes the pass gates and sources. Q2204\ndischarges the output through R2210 || R2211 = 340 Ohm; R2205 (100 kOhm)\nbleeds the remaining charge. D2201, D2203 and D2204 clamp VGS; D2202 clamps\npositive output excursions. Verify actual OFF and discharge timing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 141 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "47c8e490-83a2-4750-8120-9a33fd783b19")
	)
	(text "PROG_N15 follows the upstream N15 voltage with MOSFET and interconnect\nlosses. Its voltage is set by the upstream regulator; this sheet contains no\nadjustable regulator or local current-limit setting. The 10 V zeners limit\ngate-source stress, rather than setting the programming amplitude."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "490cdad6-118e-4cc7-a95e-52f1dcb72c6e")
	)
