	(text "Q2201 and Q2202 (AO3400A) form an opposed NMOS pair with common sources and\njoined gates. Their body diodes block both current directions while the pair\nis off. C2202 (4.7 uF nominal) stores and filters the output. R2204 (680 Ohm)\nand C2201 (47 nF) shape gate/output transitions."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
